{"text":"purananuru","n":282,"lines":["திணையும் துறையும் தெரிந்தில","எ·குஉளம் கழிய இருநில மருங்கின்","அருங்கடன் இறுத்த பெருஞ்செ யாளனை","யாண்டுளனோ வென வினவுதி ஆயின்","…","வருபடை தாங்கிக் கிளர்தார் அகலம்","அருங்கடன் இறுமார் வயவர் எறிய","உடம்பும் தோன்றா உயிர்கெட் டன்றே","மலையுநர் மடங்கி மாறுஎதிர் கழியத்","அலகை போகிச் சிதைந்து வேறு ஆகிய","பலகை அல்லது களத்துஒழி யதே","சேண்விளங்கு நல்லிசை நிறீஇ","நாநவில் புலவர் வாய் உளானே"],"tr":["tiṇaiyum tuṟaiyum terintila","ekuuḷam kaḻiya irunila maruṅkiṉ","aruṅkaṭaṉ iṟutta peruñce yāḷaṉai","yāṇṭuḷaṉō veṉa viṉavuti āyiṉ","","varupaṭai tāṅkik kiḷartār akalam","aruṅkaṭaṉ iṟumār vayavar eṟiya","uṭampum tōṉṟā uyirkeṭ ṭaṉṟē","malaiyunar maṭaṅki māṟuetir kaḻiyat","alakai pōkic citaintu vēṟu ākiya","palakai allatu kaḷattuoḻi yatē","cēṇviḷaṅku nallicai niṟīi","nānavil pulavar vāy uḷāṉē"],"colophon":{"poet_ta":"பாலை பாடிய பெருங்கடுங்கோ","poet_tr":"Pālai Pāṭiya Peruṅkaṭuṅkō"},"scan":{"meter":"not a regular āciriyappā","ok":false,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"13 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":false,"detail":"11×4, 1×3, 1×0 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 47"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 24, veṇṭaḷai 22"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"திணையும்","tr":"tiṇaiyum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"திணை","tr":"tiṇai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]},{"text":"துறையும்","tr":"tuṟaiyum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துறை","tr":"tuṟai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]},{"text":"தெரிந்தில","tr":"terintila","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தெரிந்","tr":"terin"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தில","tr":"tila"}]}],[{"text":"வெகுவுளம்","tr":"vekuvuḷam","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வெகு","tr":"veku"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வுளம்","tr":"vuḷam"}]},{"text":"கழிய","tr":"kaḻiya","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கழி","tr":"kaḻi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":